{"id":"n41454-1-7","stage":3,"title":"네모 · 四角","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41454-1-7-1","ko":"네모가 반듯한 이 종이는 모서리가 몇 개죠?","zh":"这张四边整齐的纸，一共有几个角呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네모가","meaning":"四角","explanation":"네모：四角；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"네모","audio":"/audio/397dc4d04e5b98d4141b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41454","senseId":"1","lemma":"네모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네모가","audio":"/audio/3b317228e81f598b4887.mp3"}},{"text":"반듯한","meaning":"端正，整齐","explanation":"반듯하다：端正，整齐；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"반듯하다","audio":"/audio/1e300d2d21deaae744f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56877","senseId":"1","lemma":"반듯하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반듯한","audio":"/audio/e77b68eb4469b197e2f7.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"종이는","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종이는","audio":"/audio/55b8a3b701e6642eae28.mp3"}},{"text":"모서리가","meaning":"棱，角","explanation":"모서리：棱，角；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모서리","audio":"/audio/22884408eb86ad19fbd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55796","senseId":"1","lemma":"모서리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모서리가","audio":"/audio/7b5f394fdc7f0bc22705.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"개죠?","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개죠","audio":"/audio/34f624935f52dfebd822.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"397dc4d04e5b98d4","term":"네모","zh":"四角","audio":"/audio/397dc4d04e5b98d4141b.mp3","entryId":"41454","definition":"四个棱角。","pronunciation":["네ː모"]},{"id":"1e300d2d21deaae7","term":"반듯하다","zh":"端正，整齐","audio":"/audio/1e300d2d21deaae744f9.mp3","entryId":"56877","definition":"正而不歪斜或弯曲，也不散乱。","pronunciation":["반드타다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"22884408eb86ad19","term":"모서리","zh":"棱，角","audio":"/audio/22884408eb86ad19fbd2.mp3","entryId":"55796","definition":"东西的棱角边缘。","pronunciation":["모서리"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]}],"audio":"/audio/84439865a636793a27f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41454-1-7-2","ko":"네 개요.","zh":"四个哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"四","explanation":"네：四。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64556","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c